  "material": true,
  "note": "The 'blood on me' line is from a later interview with Hibbs the host plays (\"that terrible interview... Frank goes through great lengths to remind Pastor Hibbs\"), recalling the FaceTime: \">> Then I FaceTimed you... You saw I had blood on me.\" Not said during the FaceTime.",
  "fix": {
   "claim": "In a clip of an interview with Pastor Jack Hibbs that the host plays, Frank Turek, recalling that he FaceTimed Hibbs after arriving at the hospital, says \"You saw I had blood on me,\" which the host characterizes as leading the conversation.",
   "label": "Frank Turek Tells Jack Hibbs in Interview That Hibbs Saw Him With Blood on Him at the Hospital"
  }
 },
